// title: TA4557 drops More Eggs
// date: 2026-10-23
// product: Defender for Endpoint
// tables: DeviceEvents
// purpose: TA4557 drops More Eggs
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/DefenderXDR/TA4557%20drops%20More_Eggs.kql
// kind: repo
